Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:46.07,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我今天也有點慌亂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.10,0:00:47.53,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}啊　睡過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.33,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}梳妝打扮可不能偷工減料
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:51.08,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不行不行，怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.24,0:00:52.81,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}抓住Cute　心跳Magic！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:54.48,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}這件連身裙，很適合我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:56.38,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不快點不行，已經這時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:58.13,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好，我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:03.40,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}原諒我吧　我也總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.61,0:01:06.27,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}會長大成人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:12.42,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}但你還要待在我身邊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.79,0:01:17.07,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為　因為　很可怕嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:20.63,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}微微一笑　很困擾嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:23.53,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}在你那大大的手臂之中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.63,0:01:27.72,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我想一直撒嬌下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:31.07,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}等等我　好好地　回應我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:33.71,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}別裝作沒聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:39.83,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}即使魔法消失
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.91,0:01:42.05,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}緊緊　緊緊擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:45.41,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:48.98,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}摸摸　摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:52.61,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
